  "content": "<div>\n<div style=\"margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\"><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/4zVxJZnJ9iM?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"100%\"></iframe></span></div>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Ol1Tcf8.png\" width=\"180\" height=\"60\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bclib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/paulevsGitch/BCLib/main/bclib_banner.png\" width=\"180\" height=\"60\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/kYuATbYbKW\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn-icons-png.flaticon.com/512/2111/2111370.png\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\"></a> &nbsp; <a href=\"https://github.com/paulevsGitch/BetterEnd/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn-icons-png.flaticon.com/512/25/25231.png\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\"></a>&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.buymeacoffee.com%252fquiqueck\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.buymeacoffee.com/buttons/v2/default-yellow.png\" alt=\"Buy Me A Coffee\" width=\"217\" height=\"60\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>模組介紹：</strong></span></p><p>這個模組為終界添加了新的生態域並改造了原有生態域。每個生態域都有獨特的氛圍、資源和生物群系。天空將呈現紫色星雲與星辰交織的奇幻景觀。所有生態域都配有專屬音樂、音效和環境特效，讓探索過程充滿生機與驚喜。BetterEnd採用自訂終界地形生成器，中央島嶼擁有獨特結構設計。新型生成器會創造出形狀各異、海拔不同的浮空島，島內還隱藏著蘊藏稀有資源的洞穴系統。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>特色內容：</strong></span></p><ul>\n<li>24+個全新生態域（持續增加中）</li>\n<li>6種新生物（部分具備生態域變異形態）</li>\n<li>大量新增方塊，包含9種木材與7種石材</li>\n<li>豐富新物品，包括食物來源、工具、護甲與武器</li>\n<li>創新機制如灌注儀式、鐵砧配方、終界工具進階系統等</li>\n<li>多模組兼容，例如為BYG生態域新增2種子生態域（1.16版）與專屬植物</li>\n<li>可配置的終界地形生成器，可能性遠超原版</li>\n<li>支援方塊、物品、生物、附魔等多項參數調整</li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>遊戲截圖：</strong></span></p><table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/317/161/2020-10-17_10.png\" width=\"417\" height=\"221\"></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/317/879/2020-10-21_17.png\" width=\"417\" height=\"221\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/330/861/2020-12-28_17.png\" width=\"417\" height=\"221\"></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/328/798/2020-12-20_21.png\" width=\"417\" height=\"221\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/324/921/2020-11-27_20.png\" width=\"417\" height=\"221\"></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/328/795/2020-12-20_21.png\" width=\"417\" height=\"221\"></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><strong>玩家評測：</strong></strong></span></p><table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/97_AjrikgpE?wmode=transparent\" height=\"221\" width=\"417\"></iframe></span></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/VEkIKbwwmB0?wmode=transparent\" height=\"221\" width=\"417\"></iframe></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><strong>兼容模組：</strong></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/roughly-enough-items\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/282/25/64/64/637287701215436754.png\"></a> &nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/canvas-renderer\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/197/845/64/64/636895665884150904.png\"></a> &nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/patchouli-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/283/385/64/64/637292980729992711.png\"></a> &nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/oh-the-biomes-youll-go-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/281/230/64/64/637284761944802812.png\"></a> &nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/colored-lights-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/392/890/64/64/637587622695448568.png\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><strong>其他作品：</strong></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/betterend\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/471/575/64/64/637760294980874674.png\"></a> &nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bclib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/396/271/64/64/637595638220205053.png\"></a> &nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/infgen\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/271/438/64/64/637248195374592724.png\"></a> &nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/skyworld\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/265/428/64/64/637229325539187031.png\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/eden-ring\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/528/386/64/64/637851066965542722.png\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/wunderreich\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/521/221/64/64/637840028913935424.jpeg\"></a></p>",
